sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant AppClient as Client App
    participant OAuth as OAuth2 Server
    participant AppServer as Resource Server

    %% --- Authorization Request (OAuth2 + PKCE) ---
    User->>AppClient: Start login

    rect rgba(200, 230, 255, 0.4)
        note over AppClient: PKCE (RFC 7636)
        AppClient->>AppClient: Generate code_verifier
        AppClient->>AppClient: Derive code_challenge = BASE64URL(SHA256(code_verifier))
    end

    AppClient->>AppClient: Generate state

    AppClient->>OAuth: Authorization Request<br/>response_type=code<br/>client_id<br/>redirect_uri<br/>scope<br/>state<br/>code_challenge<br/>code_challenge_method=S256

    %% --- User Authentication ---
    OAuth->>User: Login & Consent
    User->>OAuth: Credentials / Consent

    %% --- Authorization Response ---
    OAuth->>AppClient: Redirect with<br/>authorization_code + state
    AppClient->>AppClient: Verify state

    %% --- Token Exchange (PKCE verification) ---
    AppClient->>OAuth: Token Request<br/>grant_type=authorization_code<br/>code<br/>redirect_uri<br/>client_id<br/>client_secret(optional)<br/>code_verifier

    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate code + PKCE (code_verifier ↔ code_challenge)
    OAuth->>AppClient: Token Response<br/>access_token<br/>refresh_token<br/>expires_in

    %% --- API Access ---
    AppClient->>AppServer: API Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    AppServer->>AppClient: Protected Resource

    %% --- Token Refresh ---
    AppClient->>OAuth: Refresh Request<br/>grant_type=refresh_token<br/>refresh_token
    OAuth->>AppClient: New access_token (+ optional new refresh_token)
